  "_about": "Placeholder story scenes for Harrow Landing (played by StoryDirector, scripts/field/story_director.gd; the real cutscene system is M6-3). A scene: room, trigger {on: enter, spawn?, area?}, if, once (flag set when it starts), freeze (default true), steps. Steps: say, move {actor, to [x, z], speed, wait}, face, wait {s}, show, hide, set_flag, clear_flag, give_item, take_item, credits, beat, battle {encounter, first_turn}, join {member, at}. Every step may carry its own 'if'. Beats: b1_night, b2_otis_joined, b3_home_again. Added with the ore train: wait_action {action, prompt} (waits for a button, the prompt text is a key of data/text/train.json), goto {room, spawn}, run {scene} (plays another scene's steps here), and join now also joins the party (GameState.join_party).",
